### Feature Owner — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name updateOwnerPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document_type": "CC",
  "document_number": "1234567890",
  "name": "Ana Pérez Actualizada",
  "phone": "3009876543",
  "email": "ana.perez@example.com",
  "is_active": true
}

###

# @name updateOwnerPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/propietarios/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "3011112233"
}
